<?php use app\services\Ui;use yii\helpers\Html;$this->title='HEMIS integratsiyasi'; ?>
<div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">TASHQI MA’LUMOTLAR</span><h1>HEMIS integratsiyasi</h1><p>Tashkilot tuzilmasi va xodimlarni rasmiy API orqali yuklang.</p></div></div><div class="form-grid"><section class="card"><h2>Ulanish sozlamalari</h2><?= Html::beginForm(['admin/hemis'],'post') ?><?= Html::hiddenInput('operation','configure') ?><?= Ui::input('HEMIS domeni','host',$settings['host']??'','text',['required'=>true,'placeholder'=>'hemis.universitet.uz']) ?><?= Ui::input('API kaliti (saqlanganni qoldirish uchun bo‘sh qoldiring)','token','','password',['autocomplete'=>'new-password']) ?><p class="muted"><?= empty($settings['token'])?'API kaliti hali saqlanmagan.':'API kaliti saqlangan. Xavfsizlik uchun maydon bosh korsatiladi. Bosh qoldirsangiz oldingi kalit saqlanadi.' ?></p><button class="button">Sozlamalarni saqlash</button><?= Html::endForm() ?></section><aside class="card form-note"><h2>Import tartibi</h2><p>Avval tuzilmani, keyin xodimlarni yuklang. Mavjud yozuvlar HEMIS identifikatori bilan yangilanadi.</p><p>Yangi xodimlar nofaol holatda yaratiladi. Administrator ularning toifasi, vaqtinchalik paroli va faolligini tekshirib ochadi.</p><p>HEMIS administratori API kaliti bilan bergan backend domenidan foydalaning. Student kabineti domeni REST API domenidan farq qilishi mumkin.</p><p>Domen server tarmoq ruxsatlarida ochiq bo‘lishi kerak. Kalitni chatga yubormang.</p></aside></div><section class="card"><h2>Ma’lumotlarni yuklash</h2><div class="actions"><?php foreach(['test'=>'Ulanishni tekshirish','structure'=>'Tuzilmani import qilish','employees'=>'Xodimlarni import qilish'] as $op=>$label): ?><?= Html::beginForm(['admin/hemis'],'post') ?><?= Html::hiddenInput('operation',$op) ?><button class="button secondary"><?= Ui::h($label) ?></button><?= Html::endForm() ?><?php endforeach ?></div><p class="muted">Import mavjud hisoblarning paroli, roli, KPI toifasi va faolligini o‘zgartirmaydi. Pasport va JSHIR ma’lumotlari olinmaydi.</p></section>
